</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/72b36e5e-73b0-11f1-ae7d-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/000-Par3455573.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/72b36e5e-73b0-11f1-ae7d-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/000-Par3455573.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">3142793e-7391-11f1-a80c-7d8eb55a1ec6</guid><pubDate>Tue, 30 Jun 2026 05:57:41 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/72b36e5e-73b0-11f1-ae7d-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/000-Par3455573.jpg">AFP - THOMAS COEX</source><dc:creator>RFI</dc:creator></item><item><category>France</category><title>Anti-independence parties make gains in New Caledonia provincial poll</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/en/france/20260629-anti-independence-parties-make-gains-in-new-caledonia-provincial-poll</link><description>
